&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mizjeannie.com/almanac"&gt;在米兹·珍妮的网站上规划这一天 →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Correspondences for November 16, 2026. Color: Indigo — divination, discernment, inner-work, dreams. Crystal: Amethyst — divination, temperance, protection, spiritual insight. Herb: Mugwort (Artemisia vulgaris) — divination, dreams, protection, intuition. The graphic also explains why each fits today's almanac context." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afae3960e140.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:06:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>尊重室友的巫术实践</title><link>https://some.pics/6afa6e79c6d18</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你的巫术可以尊重与你同住的人。如果室友不喜欢熏香，你可以不点燃任何东西而说出祝福。这种调整体现了对你自己的修行和你们共同居所的关怀。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted fantasy cottage interior in charcoal and muted rose, with a witch blessing an open doorway beside a comfortably reading housemate. Lily-pad stepping stones cross blue-green water toward a cottage on a giant lily pad. Ivory serif lettering fills the upper wall, and a gold emblem watermark appears at bottom-right. Text: Your witchcraft can respect the people you live with. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afa6e79c6d18.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:46:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日天空</title><link>https://some.pics/6afa4243b6d9d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今日天空&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Light wispy clouds streaking across a pale blue sky." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6afa4243b6d9d.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:37:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>暗眼灯草鹀</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9fbc34c24b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一只暗眼灯草鹀。我以前从未见过这些，不得不查了一下。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A dark gray bird with a white chest and white beak" height="1280" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af9fbc34c24b.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:36:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>两颗心</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9e9dbacc05</link><description>&lt;p&gt;两颗心&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Two hearts drawn on a black surface through a thin layer of ice. A larger heart and a smaller one, rotated by 90 degrees, next to it.  The title could refer to the song of the same name by Phil Collins, Chris Isaak or Stacey Q, depending on how old one is and what sort of music one listened to back then. " height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6af9e9dbacc05.jpg" width="3449"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:20:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>慕尼黑狮子餐厅早午餐</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9ca9a665e9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;慕尼黑狮子餐厅早午餐。自制饼干配培根肉汁和芝士炒蛋。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Wide angle view of Amy's back, facing the sink. To her right two pans of homemade biscuits on the counter. To her left on the glass stovetop is the homemade bacon gravy and the scrambled eggs are just out of view." height="3072" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/duggan/6af9ca9a665e9.jpg" width="4080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://duggan.some.pics"&gt;@duggan&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:07:12 +0000</pubDa